+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "# Video-Overlap-Tube-State C1 candidate\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Run all executes one copper-kettle source, OFF / PAYLOAD_MULTI / OVERLAP_MULTI, each with a complete independent 50-step native Wan trajectory. Both marked arms use fresh conditional updates at25..49. Existing four-channel repeated32-bit payload stays unchanged. The overlap pilot uses real spatial channel4, four4x4 blocks and four orthogonal age subspaces; actual summed pilot update has an L2 cap1 per step. Target norm1, actual update norm and25-step accumulated norms are distinct. Total arm budgets are not matched.\n",
